{"2550240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VOID CRAWLER", "steam_appid": 2550240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.poster.avif?t=1760968050\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.webm?t=1760968050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.mp4?t=1760968050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Void Crawler</strong> is a first-person horror game set in a dystopian future. You pilot a drilling vehicle nicknamed <i>“The Mole”</i> into a mysterious underground void to extract a rare and powerful crystal for a corporation that claims it can solve the world’s energy crisis.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Marcus Everett</strong>, a veteran tank operator and machinery expert, who has withdrawn from duty after the tragic loss of his 12-year-old daughter. His grief is interrupted by an unexpected call from <strong>Void Energies</strong>, offering him a lucrative contract: return to the driver’s seat, and put his skills to use in exchange for a life-changing paycheck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the darkness</strong> using The Mole’s infrared camera and radar, uncovering hidden dangers and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in dread</strong> through a first-person perspective that heightens the claustrophobic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive under pressure</strong> by managing The Mole’s vital systems — battery, oil, and coolant. Extracting crystals drains your power, so timely deliveries to the dock are essential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate heavy machinery</strong> with intense, tactile gameplay as you drill deeper into the void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face psychological horror</strong> with hallucinations, fear, and escalating tension that test your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience gritty visuals</strong> that amplify the oppressive, industrial tone of the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.poster.avif?t=1760968050\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.webm?t=1760968050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/extras/fd55a32cdfd76a4ba100c5c18d0c765b.mp4?t=1760968050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Void Crawler</strong> is a first-person horror game set in a dystopian future. You pilot a drilling vehicle nicknamed <i>“The Mole”</i> into a mysterious underground void to extract a rare and powerful crystal for a corporation that claims it can solve the world’s energy crisis.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Marcus Everett</strong>, a veteran tank operator and machinery expert, who has withdrawn from duty after the tragic loss of his 12-year-old daughter. His grief is interrupted by an unexpected call from <strong>Void Energies</strong>, offering him a lucrative contract: return to the driver’s seat, and put his skills to use in exchange for a life-changing paycheck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the darkness</strong> using The Mole’s infrared camera and radar, uncovering hidden dangers and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in dread</strong> through a first-person perspective that heightens the claustrophobic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive under pressure</strong> by managing The Mole’s vital systems — battery, oil, and coolant. Extracting crystals drains your power, so timely deliveries to the dock are essential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate heavy machinery</strong> with intense, tactile gameplay as you drill deeper into the void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face psychological horror</strong> with hallucinations, fear, and escalating tension that test your sanity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience gritty visuals</strong> that amplify the oppressive, industrial tone of the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures in individuals with photosensitive epilepsy.</i></p>", "short_description": "Void Crawler is a horror game set in a dystopian future, where you pilot a vehicle nicknamed 'The Mole' into a mysterious void deep within the Earth to collect an extremely valuable material for a company dedicated to solving the world's energy crisis.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550240/header.jpg?t=1760968050", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st